  "description": "Centro Western is a bold and expressive vintage display font inspired by classic western typography and old-style signage. Featuring strong letterforms with a distressed texture, this font brings an authentic retro feel to your designs.\nPerfect for branding, posters, logos, packaging, t-shirt designs, signage, and vintage-themed projects, Centro Western captures the rugged charm of the wild west with a modern twist.\nWhether you’re creating bold headlines or standout graphic designs, this font delivers a powerful visual impact.\nKey Features\nUppercase characters\nDistressed vintage texture\nBold and strong display style\nWestern & retro aesthetic\nEasy to use for headlines and logos",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Centro Western is a bold and expressive vintage display font inspired by classic western typography and old-style signage. Featuring strong letterforms with a distressed texture, this font brings an authentic retro feel to your designs.</p>\n<p>Perfect for branding, posters, logos, packaging, t-shirt designs, signage, and vintage-themed projects, Centro Western captures the rugged charm of the wild west with a modern twist.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re creating bold headlines or standout graphic designs, this font delivers a powerful visual impact.</p>\n<p>Key Features<br>\nUppercase characters<br>\nDistressed vintage texture<br>\nBold and strong display style<br>\nWestern &amp; retro aesthetic<br>\nEasy to use for headlines and logos</p>",
